From c346fb8c7b6f1c6e2421a54c12aecf3566335bef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tomeu Vizoso <tomeu.vizoso@collabora.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Mar 2026 08:19:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/37] etnaviv/ml: remove screen references from compilation
 path

Move hardware description from etna_screen into etna_ml_device by
storing pointers to etna_core_info and etna_specs. This removes all
references to etna_screen from the compilation path, keeping screen
usage only in runtime paths (BO creation, job submission).

This follows the same pattern as the ethosu driver, enabling
ahead-of-time compilation without a pipe_screen.
